  "id": "representational-stage",
  "term": "representational stage",
  "definition": "In this context, the representational stage is the part of lexical stress processing that involves the mental representation of stress patterns in words. It is distinguished from more peripheral problems in perceiving the sounds or producing the speech movements.",
